    THE SIM IS FIXED-STEP ON PURPOSE — "the world thinks half as often as the
    screen paints, with identical math" — so this broke a promise the code makes
    in its own comment. Dust now draws from `vrnd`, a second counter on the same
    generator. The gait offset is derived from the body's id through `hash2`,
