    no `rnd()` draw, which matters: anything that did would move every body placed after it.
    WHAT IS LEFT OPEN IS DELIBERATE and is its own assertion: 30% of a site is solid, not 100%.
    You can still walk in among the ribs and stand in the palm, because the inside of a ribcage
    is the best thing about a ribcage and a hand you cannot stand in is a wall.

[NOTE] A CAMERA IS A TOOL, AND IT NEEDS THE SAME RIGOUR AS A TEST. sunderpix.js named four HUD
