    memory is the same list read by a different reader and nothing new has to be remembered to
    call it. One hook, twenty sources.
    IT SATURATES, because flat gains make the hundredth gaunt worth as much as the first and the
    scale runs out inside a week: 0.25 known for the first kill against 0.05 at ninety.

